(PID.TID 0004.0001)                       0
(PID.TID 0004.0001)    = 0 : Off (ignore 3-D Coriolis Terms in Omega.Cos(Lat) )
(PID.TID 0004.0001)    = 1 : original discretization ; = 2 : using averaged Transport
(PID.TID 0004.0001)    = 3 : same as 2 with hFac in gW_Cor
