(PID.TID 0004.0001)    = 1 : Wet-point averaging (Jamar & Ozer 1986)
(PID.TID 0004.0001)    = 2 : hFac weighted average (Angular Mom. conserving)
(PID.TID 0004.0001)    = 3 : energy conserving scheme using hFac weighted average
