(PID.TID 0004.0001)    = 2 : energy conserving scheme (used by Sadourny in JAS 75 paper)
(PID.TID 0004.0001)    = 3 : energy (general) and enstrophy (2D, nonDiv.) conserving scheme
(PID.TID 0004.0001)          from Sadourny (Burridge & Haseler, ECMWF Rep.4, 1977)
(PID.TID 0004.0001)    = 4 : shift 1/hFac from Vorticity to gU,gV tend. (Ang.Mom. conserving)
